Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,Outreach gets messy\Nfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:03.49,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who did I message?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:04.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.62,0:00:06.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who needs a follow-up\Ntoday?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.66,0:00:09.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,If the answer lives in\Nyour head,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.07,0:00:10.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,you will forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:13.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,So I'm building the tool\Nthat answers it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is my Today screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.97,0:00:16.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Follow-ups due.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.07,0:00:16.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Who replied.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:18.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,What to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:21.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every business has a\Nstage in the {\c&H1EB0F2&}pipeline,{\c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:23.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,and a full history I can\Nstep through,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:25.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,event by event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.11,0:00:27.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,It doesn't send anything\Nfor me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:32.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,It records what I do, and\Nshows me what I recorded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.69,0:00:35.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,I'm building it around\Nmy own outreach,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,and I'll tell you if it\Nworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.72,0:00:38.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,Andrew Builds.
